---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Cobb County Childcare | Marietta Childcare";
const description = "Extended childcare service throughout Cobb County with county service commitment and family testimonials.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <div class="min-h-screen">
    <section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-50 to-blue-50 py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Cobb County Childcare</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 mb-6">
          Cobb County Childcare extends our service throughout the county. Cobb County coverage demonstrates our commitment to serving the broader region. Cobb County families benefit from Marietta Childcare's county-wide expertise and family testimonials.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-sky-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-sky-700">Schedule a Tour</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        
        <div class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Serving Cobb County Families</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            Cobb County Childcare demonstrates our commitment to serving families throughout the county. Cobb County families benefit from our extended service and county-wide expertise. Cobb County coverage ensures quality childcare is accessible across the broader region.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
            County Service Commitment at Marietta Childcare means we understand diverse community needs throughout Cobb County. County Service Commitment supports families by providing information about county services, schools, and community resources.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Cobb County Community</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            Cobb County Community includes diverse families seeking quality childcare throughout the county. Cobb County encompasses multiple neighborhoods and communities. Cobb County location provides access to county-wide services and resources.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
            Community Connection at Marietta Childcare means we're invested in Cobb County. Community Connection includes partnerships with county organizations, participation in regional events, and support for county-wide initiatives.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Why Choose Cobb County Childcare</h2>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div class="bg-sky-50 rounded-lg p-6">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">County-Wide Service</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700">Comprehensive service throughout Cobb County region.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-sky-50 rounded-lg p-6">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">County Expertise</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700">Deep knowledge of Cobb County communities and resources.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-sky-50 rounded-lg p-6">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Family Testimonials</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700">Trusted by families throughout Cobb County.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-sky-50 rounded-lg p-6">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Service Commitment</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700">Long-term commitment to serving Cobb County families.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-sky-50 rounded-lg p-8 mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Experience Cobb County Childcare</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
            Marietta Childcare's county-wide service demonstrates our commitment to families throughout Cobb County. Our educators provide quality care with county expertise and service commitment.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
            <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-sky-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-sky-700">Schedule a Tour</a>
            <a href="/service-areas" class="inline-block bg-white text-sky-600 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold border-2 border-sky-600 hover:bg-sky-50">View All Service Areas</a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "LocalBusiness",
      "name": "Marietta Childcare - Cobb County",
      "areaServed": "Cobb County, Georgia"
    }
    </script>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
